# Operator template, installed as /etc/hyperfide/supervisory-host.env (root:root 0600) and loaded by hyperfide-supervisory-host.service.
# The MAIN supervisory host takes its configuration from /etc/hyperfide/supervisory-host.json; this file normally stays empty.
# Never add a database URL, PG* variable, HYPERFIDE_AUTHORITY_JOURNAL_DIR, GitHub, model or provider credential here:
# the launcher refuses with SUPERVISORY_ONLY (core/control-plane/src/supervisory-host.ts FORBIDDEN_ENV).
